BASHFUL (adj.):
(1) लज्जाशीलः (ला, लं) (applied
only to persons);
(2) लज्जालु (mfn.);
(3)
लज्जावत् (f. ती): v. Modest, shamefaced.

BASTARD:
(1) जारजः (जा, जं) (=child of a
woman by her gallant);
(2) कानीनः (ना,
नं) (child of an unmarried woman);
(3) कौलटेयः (यी, यं)
or
कौलटेरः (री, रं) =
(child of a lewd woman);
(4) कुण्डः (a b.
son born when the husband is alive);
(5)
गोलकः (a b. son born after the death of the
husband);
(6) विजन्मन् (mfn.) (not born
in lawful wedlock).
